      "name": "[Fragile] High-Grade Blade of the Other: Powerslash",
      "desc": "When equipped, it grants three Alter Skills: Perfect Block, Phase Dash, and Powerful Slash.\n\n[Powerful Slash Enhancement]\nEnhancement I: When Powerful Slash is used against an elite or boss enemy, it has a <color=#2BAD00>75%</color> chance to trigger Totalize even if you are not behind the target, dealing <color=#2BAD00>50%</color> additional DMG.\n\nEnhancement II: Perfect Block increases Daze dealt to normal/elite/boss enemies by <color=#2BAD00>100%/50%/25%</color>, respectively.",
